# Hiding under a desk: the Shadow Visitor's coat and feet stop in front of
# you; then it bends all the way down and looks under the desk.
# First-person jump-scare, full screen 320x180, seen through the protagonist's
# eyes. Show the frames in order over about a second after a quiet build-up,
# with the jumpscare sound; with "reduce flashing" on, show the last frame
# only, without flicker.
# No gore (docs/decisions.md D9).
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../jumpscares/jumpscare_fp_under_desk.png
@preview ../previews/jumpscare_fp_under_desk_x2.png 2
@columns 1

@frame feet





















































































































































































@frame looks




















































































































































































